 "description": "Flagship of the range, the Flyer 10 conceals a real live-aboard powerboat behind a dayboat concept. Stylish and sporty, this large outboard powerboat offers greater thrills and four large living spaces, for everyone to enjoy!\nNew: discover the Flyer 10 Pilot Edition.\nLearn more",
