  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Larger than life !",
   "intro": "Ready to embark up to 11 passengers and fitted out so that you can spend a few extra nights at sea, this new dayboat bordering on a sport cruiser allows a variety of exciting programmes.",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "THRILLS",
     "text": "Powered by 2 x 350 hp engines, the Flyer 10 is equipped with Airstep® 2 technology and lifts off in just a few seconds to reach more than 40 knots."
    },
    {
     "title": "SUN PAD",
     "text": "This outboard powerboat boasts a distinctive “smart walkaround” concept that combines the easy movement and safety advantages of the walkaround, but with just one asymmetric walkway to port, offering greater deck and cabin space. The fore deck features a vast three place sun pad."
    },
    {
     "title": "DECK GALLEY",
     "text": "The galley behind the driving station is fully fitted, so that you can cook real meals while enjoying life aboard. There is a refrigerator, sink, twin burner above an oven, storage and even a small worktop."
    }
   ],
